---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import Eyebrow from '../components/Eyebrow.astro';

const updated = 'September 2026';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy — Conor Foy Plaster"
  description="What happens to the information you give us through this site."
>
  <Section border="none" pt={80} pb={80}>
    <div class="legal">
      <Eyebrow track={0.2} mb={24}>Privacy</Eyebrow>
      <h1 class="legal__title">What happens to your information.</h1>
      <p class="legal__updated text-muted tnum">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <div class="legal__body">
        <p>
          This site is run by Conor Foy Plaster, a decorative plaster shop in
          New York. It has no accounts and no login. The only information it
          collects is what you type into one of the forms, plus anonymous
          traffic statistics. This page explains both.
        </p>

        <h2>What the forms collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Consultation request</strong> (Contact page and Home page) —
            your name and email, and optionally your company, phone, role,
            project type, location, area, timeline, the finishes you are
            considering, and whatever you write in the message.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>JobsOxo waitlist</strong> — your name, company, email, crew
            size, and your message.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Newsletter signup</strong> — your email address only.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We ask for the optional fields because they help us give you a useful
          answer, not because we need them. Leave them blank if you prefer.
        </p>

        <h2>What we do with it</h2>
        <p>
          Consultation and waitlist submissions are emailed to us so we can
          reply — to <a href="mailto:info@conorfoy.com">info@conorfoy.com</a> for
          plaster enquiries, <a href="mailto:hello@jobsoxo.com">hello@jobsoxo.com</a>
          for JobsOxo. Newsletter addresses go onto our mailing list. That is
          the whole of it. We do not sell your information, share it for
          advertising, or use it to build a profile of you.
        </p>

        <h2>Who else handles it</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Resend</strong> (resend.com) delivers the form emails and
            stores the newsletter mailing list on our behalf.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Vercel</strong> (vercel.com) hosts the site and provides the
            traffic statistics below.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Both are US companies acting as our processors. We do not use any
          other third-party service on this site.
        </p>

        <h2>Analytics, and no cookies</h2>
        <p>
          We use Vercel Web Analytics to see how many people visit and which
          pages they read. It is <strong>cookieless</strong> and aggregate — it
          records page views, referrers, rough location by country, and device
          type, with no identifier that follows you between visits or across
          other websites. This site sets <strong>no cookies at all</strong>, and
          there is nothing to consent to.
        </p>

        <h2>No third-party requests</h2>
        <p>
          Fonts are served from this site's own domain, so — unlike most sites —
          loading a page here sends nothing to Google, an ad network, or a
          tracker. The only outbound connection your browser makes is to Vercel,
          for the analytics beacon.
        </p>

        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          We keep enquiry and waitlist correspondence for as long as we are
          working with you and for a reasonable period afterwards as a business
          record. Newsletter addresses stay on the list until you unsubscribe.
          Ask us to delete anything and we will, unless we are required to keep
          it.
        </p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>
          Every newsletter has an unsubscribe link. To see, correct, or delete
          anything else we hold about you, email
          <a href="mailto:info@conorfoy.com">info@conorfoy.com</a> and we will
          take care of it.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          If this policy changes, the date at the top changes with it. Questions
          go to <a href="mailto:info@conorfoy.com">info@conorfoy.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: 66ch;
  }
  .legal__title {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5.5vw, 56px);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  .legal__updated {
    font-size: 13px;
    margin: 0 0 40px;
  }

  .legal__body {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }
  .legal__body h2 {
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 36px 0 10px;
  }
  .legal__body p {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
  }
  .legal__body ul {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
    padding-left: 1.2em;
  }
  .legal__body li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .legal__body a {
    color: var(--color-accent-700);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
</style>
